Write the `tradeoffs` slot.

Intent: three to five sentences on where this period's spend was less effective. Ground every
observation in a figure you were given: a low cache-read share means context was being re-read
fresh, a high tool-error rate means calls were failing and being retried, interrupts and
compactions mean sessions were being steered or were outgrowing their context.

Be specific and frank about what the figures show. Do not invent friction the facts do not support,
and do not pad this with generic complaints about AI tooling.
